<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">The things that actually cause bugs in setups like this are data fetching, parsing, and the GitHub Action â€” none of which the toggle touches at all.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">So I'd say: <strong>go for it</strong>. Want me to rebuild <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">aam_hovmoller.html</code> with the three-way toggle â€” heatmap+contours, contours only, and heatmap only â€” plus the tightened Â±1.5Ïƒ color scale?</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
